  #line-at(70.08pt, 140.64pt, "parameters of the setup can be found in Table 1. At general ambient conditions (T = 293 K), phase matching is ")
  #line-at(70.08pt, 153.6pt, "achieved when the fibers are filled with xenon gas. To ensure consistency and enable meaningful comparisons across ")
