  #line-at(70.08pt, 400.44pt, "To explore how different spectral phase structures affect the transduction fidelity and quantum coherence of photonic ")
  #line-at(70.08pt, 413.28pt, "states, we focus on three representative phase profiles: linear, positive quadratic, and negative quadratic. These were ")
  #line-at(70.08pt, 426.24pt, "chosen because they correspond to common physical scenarios (such as delay lines and dispersive media) and are ")
  #line-at(70.08pt, 439.08pt, "readily implementable in practice. More importantly, each of these modulations alters the spectral-temporal structure ")
