  #line-at(70.199pt, 447.115pt, "Figure 5 presents analogous correlation maps for case 2 (1550 nm to 308 nm) and case 3 (1550 nm to 516 nm). In ")
  #line-at(70.199pt, 459.956pt, "Figure 5a and b, the 1550-to-308 nm conversion shows generally high correlation at low pulse energies, consistent ")
