  #line-at(70.199pt, 614.395pt, "thresholds at longer output field wavelengths. ")
  #line-at(70.199pt, 640.194pt, "Compared to the linear modulation, these findings show the sensitivity of phase mapping to both intermediary ")
  #line-at(70.199pt, 653.036pt, "bandwidth and energy under negative quadratic modulation. While the phase inversion between the input and output ")
  #line-at(70.199pt, 665.878pt, "field is clearly observed, maintaining high-fidelity transfer requires fine-tuning and optimization of operating ")
  #line-at(70.199pt, 678.838pt, "parameters to mitigate nonlinear distortions. ")
